{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1046.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"5202f8f1cece83494db68f318dd155bda0268eb408f013f9c7987f4019abdcb5","ja":"みんなに声かけてもらえたのも\n楽しかったしな♪","zh":"大家能来跟我搭话，\n我也很开心呢♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1046.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"261483360263f86a88be7e2196a1c810268359d417b3995c786473b9b189f31b","ja":"うん♪　「この前、野球の試合で応援してくれて\n力をもらえた」って言ってくれた人もいて……。","zh":"嗯♪ 还有人跟我说：“之前在棒球比赛时\n为我们加油，给了我们力量”……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1046.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"b2d4eae3782168d80881333e37f6b003a49968794f4618c946e10350c1a044e0","ja":"そして今日は、\nみんなが私たちを応援してくれて……。","zh":"而且今天，\n大家都为我们加油支持……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1046.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"b6679eb40db40684f2341c2c5e5615452a3f3579f327f022947844c61b607220","ja":"応援のパワーって、こんな風に\n巡っていくんだなって思いました～！","zh":"我觉得，应援的力量\n原来会像这样传递开来呢～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1046.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"0221532ab9a73d15c3d45c75c89fa253c956abd7c9e6384e4c5fde7c34505922","ja":"巡る、か……そうだな！","zh":"巡回，吗……说得也是呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
